WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:06.177
Welcome to Stillpool: a free place to understand artificial intelligence, and use it well.

2
00:00:06.254 --> 00:00:09.926
Explore how AI works, how to ask useful questions,

3
00:00:09.946 --> 00:00:13.142
how its use affects people, how to use it well,

4
00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:15.232
and how these tools are built.

5
00:00:15.252 --> 00:00:18.564
Choose a lesson from the map and begin wherever you need.

6
00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:23.418
Start with a simple explanation, or open the Deep sections for more detail.

7
00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:25.020
Prefer to listen?

8
00:00:25.098 --> 00:00:28.653
Emma reads every part aloud, at the speed you choose.

9
00:00:28.673 --> 00:00:30.662
Then try a short activity.

10
00:00:30.694 --> 00:00:36.281
Each answer comes with an explanation, so you can understand the reasoning and try again.

11
00:00:36.324 --> 00:00:39.126
Earn a badge by doing the lesson's activity.

12
00:00:39.146 --> 00:00:42.388
Finishing a lesson alone does not earn one.

13
00:00:42.466 --> 00:00:46.811
Adjust the text, spacing and colours to make reading comfortable.

14
00:00:46.831 --> 00:00:47.647
Ready?

15
00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:49.737
Start with lesson 1.1.
